If your goal is to become an AI/ML engineer who is **highly employable in 2026**, don't just learn machine learning. Learn how to **build, deploy, and scale AI systems**. Companies increasingly hire engineers who can take an idea from data to production.

Here's a roadmap that reflects what employers are looking for in 2026.

---

