## Python (Master It)

Learn:

* Variables, loops, functions
* OOP
* File handling
* Error handling
* Virtual environments
* Pip
* Type hints
* Async basics

Practice:

* Solve 100+ Python problems
* Build small scripts every day

Resources:

* Python Crash Course
* Real Python
* LeetCode (Easy)

