## What employers value most in 2026

A standout AI/ML engineer can usually demonstrate:

* Strong Python and software engineering skills.
* Practical ML and deep learning knowledge.
* Experience building LLM applications (RAG, agents, tool use).
* Ability to deploy and monitor models in production.
* A GitHub portfolio with several polished, documented projects.
* Clear communication about technical decisions and tradeoffs.

If you consistently build projects alongside your learning rather than only watching courses, you'll be much better prepared for internships and full-time AI/ML engineering roles.
